  "interpretation": [
    "M338 quantity four is independently listed in SNL96 and HB207. HB134/135 and SNL32 show a bracket below the top channel supporting the upper M339 suspension pin.",
    "M385 quantity two is listed in SNL96 and its stop is labeled behind the suspension link in HB135. It is not labeled on the low-speed view HB134. Allocate one to each track brake; this allocation is inferred.",
    "The broad foot, single transverse bored lug, rounded lower end, rear stop and its upper bent toe are interpretations of partly occluded drawings. No separate M338/M385 production drawing was located in the local figure index.",
    "The two brake planes per side follow the saved cylindrical friction faces of the track drum and low-speed brake case. Axial centering is inferred; the future M337 links, bands and pins may revise these offsets.",
    "Source-counted rivets are not yet mapped to these feet. Do not count these unfastened seats as a complete installation."
  ],
  "historical_geometry_qualified": false
}
